{
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "id": "grafana-quickpizza-working-filters",
  "title": "Build a dashboard with dependent filters",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Build a dashboard where the environment filter controls the available services, and the service filter controls the panel. You will deliberately break the panel query, use **Query inspector** to find the cause, then repair and save it.\n\nThis demo currently shows only production, so it cannot demonstrate switching between multiple environments. Dashboard variables do not apply to alert rules."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Install QuickPizza to get the demo metrics, or skip this section if its data source already exists."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "install",
      "title": "Install QuickPizza",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "step-01",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/a/grafana-demodashboards-app",
          "requirements": [],
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Open Demo Data Dashboards",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "tooltip": "Open Demo Data Dashboards."
        },
        {
          "id": "step-02",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"install-quickpizza\"], [data-testid=\"view-quickpizza\"]",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/a/grafana-demodashboards-app",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Click **Install Dashboards**, or **Go to dashboards** if it is already installed; installation reloads Grafana.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "verify": "has-datasource:grafanacloud-play-prom",
          "tooltip": "Install the demo data sources and dashboards; Grafana reloads when installation finishes.",
          "completeEarly": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [],
      "objectives": [
        "has-datasource:grafanacloud-play-prom"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "QuickPizza provides real HTTP traffic for the dashboard you will build."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create an environment filter from the metric labels so the service filter can use your selection."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "environment",
      "title": "Create environment filter",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "step-03",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/dashboard/new?from=now-1h&to=now",
          "requirements": [],
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Create a separate dashboard",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "tooltip": "Create a separate dashboard."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "id": "open-add-for-environment",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Sidebar.addButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "content": "Click **Add** to open the pane for creating a variable.",
          "tooltip": "Open the controls for adding dashboard elements.",
          "targetstate": "aria-expanded:true"
        },
        {
          "id": "step-04",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Sidebar.addNewVariableButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "tooltip": "Create the first dashboard filter.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Click **Variable** to create the environment filter."
        },
        {
          "id": "step-05",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.ElementEditPane.variableType:query} button",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "tooltip": "Populate filter options from a data source.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Choose **Query** to fetch environment options from metrics."
        },
        {
          "id": "step-06",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.ElementEditPane.variableNameInput}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "environment",
          "tooltip": "Give the filter a name that other queries can reference.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Set **Name** to `environment`; the service query will reference this name."
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "query-environment",
          "content": "Fetch environment names from the metric labels, preview the options, then apply the query.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-07",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Settings.Variables.Edit.QueryVariable.queryOptionsOpenButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Open the query editor",
              "tooltip": "Open the query editor."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-08",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSourcePicker.inputV2}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Select grafanacloud-play-prom",
              "targetvalue": "grafanacloud-play-prom",
              "tooltip": "Select grafanacloud-play-prom."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-09",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.Prometheus.variableQueryEditor.queryType} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Select Classic query",
              "targetvalue": "Classic query",
              "tooltip": "Select Classic query."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-10",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.Prometheus.variableQueryEditor.classicQuery}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Fetch environment values",
              "targetvalue": "label_values(quickpizza_server_http_requests_total{service_namespace=\"quickpizza\"}, deployment_environment)",
              "tooltip": "Fetch environment values."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-11",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Settings.Variables.Edit.QueryVariable.previewButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Preview actual query values",
              "tooltip": "Preview actual query values."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-12",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Settings.Variables.Edit.QueryVariable.applyButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Apply the variable query",
              "tooltip": "Apply the variable query."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "refresh-environment",
          "content": "Refresh environment options on time range change.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-13",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:variable-type Refresh} [role=\"combobox\"]",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Open Refresh",
              "tooltip": "Open Refresh."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-14",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "body:has({grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:variable-type Refresh}) [role=\"option\"]:text(\"On time range change\")",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Choose On time range change",
              "tooltip": "Choose On time range change."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "selection-environment",
          "content": "Enable **Multi-value** and **Include All value** so the filter can select several options; leave **Custom all value** empty to include the available options and disable **Allow custom values** to prevent unknown labels.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-15",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:selection-options-category Multi-value} input[role=\"switch\"]",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Enable Multi-value",
              "targetstate": "true",
              "tooltip": "Enable Multi-value."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-16",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:selection-options-category Include All value} input[role=\"switch\"]",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Enable Include All value",
              "targetstate": "true",
              "tooltip": "Enable Include All value."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-18",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:selection-options-category Allow custom values} input[role=\"switch\"]",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Disable Allow custom values",
              "targetstate": "false",
              "tooltip": "Disable Allow custom values."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-17",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:selection-options-category Custom all value} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Keep Custom all value empty",
              "targetvalue": "",
              "tooltip": "Keep Custom all value empty."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "section-completed:install",
        "has-datasource:grafanacloud-play-prom"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "The environment filter now gets its options from metric labels and refreshes them when the time range changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create a service filter that queries only the services in the selected environment."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "service",
      "title": "Create dependent service filter",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "step-19",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Sidebar.addButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "tooltip": "Add a second filter to the dashboard.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Click **Add** to create the dependent service filter.",
          "targetstate": "aria-expanded:true"
        },
        {
          "id": "step-20",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Sidebar.addNewVariableButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "tooltip": "Create the filter for service names.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Click **Variable**."
        },
        {
          "id": "step-21",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.ElementEditPane.variableType:query} button",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "tooltip": "Fetch available services from the selected environment.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Choose **Query** to fetch service names from metrics."
        },
        {
          "id": "step-22",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.ElementEditPane.variableNameInput}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "service",
          "tooltip": "Name the filter used by the panel query.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Set **Name** to `service`; the panel query will reference this name."
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "query-service",
          "content": "Fetch service names using ${environment:regex} to match the selected environments, preview the options, then apply the query.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-23",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Settings.Variables.Edit.QueryVariable.queryOptionsOpenButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Open the query editor",
              "tooltip": "Open the query editor."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-24",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSourcePicker.inputV2}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Select grafanacloud-play-prom",
              "targetvalue": "grafanacloud-play-prom",
              "tooltip": "Select grafanacloud-play-prom."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-25",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.Prometheus.variableQueryEditor.queryType} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Select Classic query",
              "targetvalue": "Classic query",
              "tooltip": "Select Classic query."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-26",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.Prometheus.variableQueryEditor.classicQuery}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Fetch service values",
              "targetvalue": "label_values(quickpizza_server_http_requests_total{service_namespace=\"quickpizza\", deployment_environment=~\"${environment:regex}\"}, service_name)",
              "tooltip": "Fetch service values."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-27",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Settings.Variables.Edit.QueryVariable.previewButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Preview actual query values",
              "tooltip": "Preview actual query values."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-28",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Settings.Variables.Edit.QueryVariable.applyButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Apply the variable query",
              "tooltip": "Apply the variable query."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "refresh-service",
          "content": "Refresh service options on time range change.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-29",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:variable-type Refresh} [role=\"combobox\"]",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Open Refresh",
              "tooltip": "Open Refresh."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-30",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "body:has({grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:variable-type Refresh}) [role=\"option\"]:text(\"On time range change\")",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Choose On time range change",
              "tooltip": "Choose On time range change."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "selection-service",
          "content": "Enable **Multi-value** and **Include All value** so the filter can select several options; leave **Custom all value** empty to include the available options and disable **Allow custom values** to prevent unknown labels.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-31",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:selection-options-category Multi-value} input[role=\"switch\"]",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Enable Multi-value",
              "targetstate": "true",
              "tooltip": "Enable Multi-value."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-32",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:selection-options-category Include All value} input[role=\"switch\"]",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Enable Include All value",
              "targetstate": "true",
              "tooltip": "Enable Include All value."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-34",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:selection-options-category Allow custom values} input[role=\"switch\"]",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Disable Allow custom values",
              "targetstate": "false",
              "tooltip": "Disable Allow custom values."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-33",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:selection-options-category Custom all value} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Keep Custom all value empty",
              "targetvalue": "",
              "tooltip": "Keep Custom all value empty."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "section-completed:environment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "The service query references the environment variable, so its available services depend on your environment selection."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Build a panel that uses both variables to show the request rate for the selected services."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "traffic",
      "title": "Build the traffic panel",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "create-panel",
          "content": "Add a panel, select the demo data source, and use Code mode.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-35",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Sidebar.addButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Open Add",
              "tooltip": "Open Add."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-36",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Sidebar.newPanelButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Add a panel",
              "tooltip": "Add a panel."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-37",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Sidebar.configurePanelButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Edit visualization",
              "tooltip": "Edit visualization."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-38",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSourcePicker.inputV2}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Select grafanacloud-play-prom",
              "targetvalue": "grafanacloud-play-prom",
              "tooltip": "Select grafanacloud-play-prom."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "step-39",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.General.content} {grafana:components.RadioButton.option:code}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true",
          "tooltip": "Use PromQL Code mode.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Use PromQL Code mode",
          "doIt": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "id": "step-40",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.General.content} [role=\"textbox\"][aria-label^=\"Editor content\"]",
          "content": "Plot request rate for the selected environment and services",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "action": "formfill",
          "targetvalue": "sum by (deployment_environment, service_name) (rate(quickpizza_server_http_requests_total{service_namespace=\"quickpizza\", deployment_environment=~\"${environment:regex}\", service_name=~\"${service:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "tooltip": "Plot request rate for the selected environment and services."
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "visualization",
          "content": "Choose the Time series visualization.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-42",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Tab.title:Visualizations}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Open All visualizations",
              "tooltip": "Open All visualizations."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-43",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PluginVisualization.item:Time series}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Choose Time series",
              "tooltip": "Choose Time series."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "step-44",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldInput:Title}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "QuickPizza request traffic",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Name the panel",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "tooltip": "Name the panel."
        },
        {
          "id": "step-41",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.General.content} button:text(\"Run queries\")",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "tooltip": "Run the query.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Run the query by clicking Run queries."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "id": "step-45",
          "content": "Check that the only service series is quickpizza-catalog; compare labels, since request rates change."
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "section-completed:service"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Your panel query uses regex matching to accept single, multiple, or All filter selections."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Replace the service variable with a fixed service name, then use the inspector to find why the filter no longer controls the panel."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "repair",
      "title": "Inspect and repair a broken filter",
